{
  "_doc": "Journeys J1-J7 of KIN-CONTINUE-003 as route-level walks of the REAL console (rsi/runtime/ux/walk.mjs). `steps` are declarative: goto <path> | click <text-regex or css> | fill <css> <text> | hover <text-regex or css> | key <chord> | enabled <text-regex or css> | shot <name>. Selectors are best-effort (zh+en); A selector prefixed with `?` is optional (empty-daemon / missing seed) and is recorded as skipped; any other missing or failed action is a hard failure. `enabled` asserts a control exists and is not disabled (never clicks: a throwaway daemon has no fake agent, so starting a run would launch a real CLI). `paths` maps changed files to the journeys they can affect (first match wins; no match = all journeys). `viewports` are WxH.",
